  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evaluation, Research and Learning for Yemen (MERLY)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver a holistic and adaptable MERL service, demonstrative of the new FCDO. Key workstreams include; Third-Party Monitoring (TPM) of programmes, analysis and evidence-generation to inform policy-making, and support to optimising diplomatic engagement. The broader aim of MERLY will be to ensure robust accountability and VfM of ODA and non-ODA spend by FCDO Yemen (BE Sana&#x2019;a).</narrative>
  </description>
